   "source": [
    "# S2-03 · Daily ticket history\n",
    "\n",
    "Counts tickets per department per day (SAST), fills days with no tickets with 0, and saves the result for the S2-08 forecast.\n",
    "\n",
    "Input: `ml/data/tickets.csv`, exported from the `tickets` table with columns `id, department, created_at, is_historical, status`.\n",
    "\n",
    "The date range comes from the data, not hard-coded dates. Days between the historical and live tickets are labelled `gap` so they are visible and are not mistaken for real history."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "metadata": {},
    "Counts **tickets per department per day** (South African time) over the past year, fills days with no tickets with 0,\n",
    "and charts the patterns the workload forecast (S2-08) learns from.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Data:** the year of past tickets in `data/processed/combined_tickets.csv` (S1-06). It's the same file the seed script (S1-17)\n",
    "loaded into the database, so this notebook needs no export and anyone can re-run it.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Decision (Samukelo, 5 Nov):** the forecast learns from the **past tickets only**. Live tickets in Relay are still test traffic\n",
    "from the team (about 1 a day), and mixing two weeks of them in would pull the forecast down by about a third.\n",
    "Once Relay has real users, live tickets can be added.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Runs in Google Colab or on a laptop:** *Run all*. The first cell finds the repo, or downloads it in Colab."
   ]
  },
  {
